WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 34]

01:43.060 --> 01:44.220
Do you know

01:44.620 --> 01:46.300
I may actually lose her?

01:46.979 --> 01:47.979
I can feel

01:48.539 --> 01:49.940
she's going to give me up.

01:52.460 --> 01:52.860
What?

01:54.580 --> 01:55.580
You don't want to?

01:57.020 --> 01:57.860
What's wrong?

02:00.740 --> 02:03.140
General Fu, if there's nothing else,

02:04.210 --> 02:05.860
I'll leave now.

02:06.620 --> 02:08.620
Is my brother going to abandon me too

02:08.900 --> 02:10.900
and keep me here for a hundred years?

02:15.660 --> 02:16.780
General Fu,

02:17.380 --> 02:19.900
His Majesty really loves you.

02:20.810 --> 02:21.450
Mr. Tai,

02:22.660 --> 02:24.720
I can't stay here for a hundred years.

02:25.380 --> 02:26.180
No way!

02:37.579 --> 02:38.340
Mr. Tai.

02:55.290 --> 02:56.490
These tonic products

02:56.530 --> 02:57.810
are from Master Zhuo.

02:58.700 --> 02:59.740
These are

02:59.980 --> 03:02.380
all fine silks from the Purple Bamboo Peak.

03:03.180 --> 03:04.420
This Baoyi Xuanjian

03:04.420 --> 03:05.500
is a gift from me.

03:06.260 --> 03:07.540
It can make you more focused

03:07.540 --> 03:09.860
when practicing kung fu.

03:15.500 --> 03:16.760
What about my brother?

03:17.620 --> 03:19.350
He didn't prepare a gift for me?

03:23.380 --> 03:24.579
I'm sure he did.

03:24.860 --> 03:25.860
It's just that

03:25.970 --> 03:28.300
he's been busy with the Four Seasons Monument thing.

03:28.300 --> 03:30.860
So, he didn't have time to give it to you.

03:34.660 --> 03:36.260
You don't have to comfort me.

03:36.620 --> 03:37.420
I know

03:38.260 --> 03:40.720
my brother doesn't approve of the marriage.

03:40.740 --> 03:42.600
He just doesn't want to talk to me.

03:43.460 --> 03:44.180
Luo Ning.

03:45.930 --> 03:47.730
Your brother loves you too much.

03:48.180 --> 03:50.579
So he doesn't feel comfortable about this.

03:53.860 --> 03:54.460
Liu Shao.

03:55.579 --> 03:56.980
You must tell my brother.

03:58.220 --> 03:59.880
As long as I can lift the curse,

04:00.740 --> 04:02.400
from now on, no matter how He Na

04:02.530 --> 04:03.580
and I get along,

04:04.260 --> 04:05.860
I will try my best to be happy.

04:06.500 --> 04:07.830
I won't think nonsense.

04:10.580 --> 04:11.570
As for gifts,

04:13.380 --> 04:15.240
I don't care if he gives them to me.

04:16.540 --> 04:17.740
I'm just afraid

04:18.339 --> 04:20.140
that he will be torn

04:20.579 --> 04:21.700
by this marriage.

04:24.860 --> 04:25.780
Don't worry.

04:26.980 --> 04:28.310
He will understand you.

04:56.659 --> 04:58.820
I can't believe the restraint set by my brother

04:58.820 --> 04:59.860
is so strong.

05:01.220 --> 05:03.750
Does he really want to lock me up for 100 years?

05:25.220 --> 05:26.220
Immortal Master.

05:26.500 --> 05:28.420
I heard from the people in the Demon Palace

05:28.420 --> 05:30.550
that Luo Ge has agreed to the marriage.

05:36.060 --> 05:39.540
Now, you go and tell Fu

05:39.860 --> 05:42.300
the happy news.

05:59.820 --> 06:01.080
There's no need to try.

06:01.340 --> 06:03.060
I can do nothing about it

06:03.420 --> 06:04.380
even if my spiritual veins are not sealed off.

06:04.380 --> 06:05.180
Let alone you.

06:05.740 --> 06:06.900
What can I do?

06:07.330 --> 06:08.780
I barely made it inside.

06:10.220 --> 06:11.680
Let's not talk about that.

06:11.900 --> 06:13.160
How's your situation?

06:13.580 --> 06:14.220
Liu Shao,

06:14.380 --> 06:15.060
Luo Ge

06:15.130 --> 06:15.860
and my brother have been in a lot of trouble

06:15.860 --> 06:17.060
because of you.

06:17.740 --> 06:19.270
They didn't come after you?

06:19.300 --> 06:20.100
No.

06:20.700 --> 06:23.180
The Demon King in White is busy with his marriage.

06:23.180 --> 06:25.580
Immortal Luo Ge is busy with his sister's marriage.

06:25.580 --> 06:28.040
I don't think they can take care of me for now.

06:28.140 --> 06:28.980
Marriage?

06:30.820 --> 06:32.150
His sister's marriage?

06:34.220 --> 06:35.300
He Na is not

06:35.380 --> 06:36.780
marrying Luo Ning, is he?

06:37.260 --> 06:39.060
If it wasn't,

06:39.180 --> 06:40.900
why would your brother lock you up here?

06:40.900 --> 06:43.100
It's because I hurt Luo Ning by mistake.

06:43.540 --> 06:45.300
If my brother doesn't punish me,

06:45.300 --> 06:47.050
how should he explain this to the Immortal Palace?

06:47.050 --> 06:48.100
Besides,

06:48.100 --> 06:49.430
it's only for a few days.

06:49.740 --> 06:52.140
Just a few days will be enough.

06:52.530 --> 06:54.180
By the time you get out,

06:54.340 --> 06:56.300
your beloved little fairy Luo Ning

06:56.300 --> 06:58.100
would have been the Demon Queen,

06:58.100 --> 07:00.030
the wife of the Demon King in White.

07:02.980 --> 07:03.500
Shut up!

07:04.340 --> 07:05.470
That's impossible!

07:06.180 --> 07:08.110
Even if my brother is angry with me,

07:08.290 --> 07:10.290
he won't take my beloved as his wife.

07:10.660 --> 07:12.060
Even if Luo Ning is angry,

07:12.420 --> 07:13.700
she won't marry He Na.

07:14.140 --> 07:15.650
The demon king is getting married.

07:15.650 --> 07:17.100
The immortal's sister is getting married.

07:17.100 --> 07:18.780
It's a big event of the Three Realms.

07:18.780 --> 07:20.580
Just ask around and you will know.

07:20.580 --> 07:21.930
I can't make it up.

07:23.460 --> 07:25.660
Your brother is marrying your beloved.

07:26.380 --> 07:28.220
I'm afraid you'll never get out.

07:32.300 --> 07:33.300
That's nonsense.

07:34.020 --> 07:35.420
The reason I don't fight

07:35.940 --> 07:37.400
is because it's my brother

07:37.620 --> 07:38.680
who has trapped me.

07:38.700 --> 07:39.940
If I want to go out,

07:40.380 --> 07:41.240
who can stop me?

07:43.260 --> 07:45.340
It's your brother's boundary.

07:45.740 --> 07:46.860
Do you think

07:47.460 --> 07:48.580
you can break it?

07:48.900 --> 07:49.830
Don't you forget

07:50.340 --> 07:51.180
Luo Ge

07:51.580 --> 07:52.700
and the Immortal Palace

07:52.700 --> 07:53.830
have their fear too.

07:54.500 --> 07:56.340
Do you know

07:56.860 --> 07:58.860
who gave me the Moon Poison that day?

08:02.380 --> 08:04.780
There are many things you don't know.

08:05.580 --> 08:07.130
What don't I know?

08:20.860 --> 08:24.380
You can actually break through the boundary of the Aquatic Demons?

08:24.380 --> 08:25.180
That's right.

08:26.420 --> 08:28.540
Are you ready to take back your beloved?

08:28.540 --> 08:29.300
Fu.

08:32.390 --> 08:36.880
[Gift list]

08:33.940 --> 08:35.220
This is Luo Ning's dowry list.

08:35.220 --> 08:35.900
Take a look.

08:43.580 --> 08:44.840
I have something else.

08:45.460 --> 08:46.990
Remember to add to it for me.

08:47.620 --> 08:48.700
What goodies?

08:49.500 --> 08:50.960
You can just give it to her.

08:51.420 --> 08:52.540
If you put it in there,

08:52.540 --> 08:54.270
she may not open it for decades.

08:54.820 --> 08:57.020
It's up to her whether she uses it or not.

08:57.130 --> 08:59.460
It's up to me whether to give it away or not.

09:01.700 --> 09:02.300
By the way,

09:02.860 --> 09:03.780
if you don't go,

09:03.900 --> 09:05.430
I have a feeling she'll cry.

09:11.500 --> 09:12.420
Have you finished

09:12.420 --> 09:13.860
copying the scriptures I assigned you?

09:13.860 --> 09:14.570
No.

09:15.060 --> 09:17.090
I've been told to copy scriptures since I was a child.

09:17.090 --> 09:18.220
It seems endless.

09:21.500 --> 09:22.380
Are you dumb?

09:22.380 --> 09:23.510
Are you going or not?

09:28.920 --> 09:31.730
[Meditation Spell]

09:29.660 --> 09:31.580
Aren't these the scriptures

09:31.940 --> 09:34.270
that you've been forcing Luo Ning to copy?

09:37.260 --> 09:38.140
Brother.

09:38.460 --> 09:39.420
Can you not

09:39.420 --> 09:41.780
be away for so long?

09:42.740 --> 09:43.900
I'm afraid

09:43.900 --> 09:46.260
that I'll never see you again.

09:46.540 --> 09:47.980
Can you?

10:41.340 --> 10:42.380
Where is my brother?

10:42.380 --> 10:43.380
Why isn't he here?

10:44.860 --> 10:45.990
He's probably busy.

10:46.100 --> 10:47.360
I'm sure he'll be here.

10:50.340 --> 10:51.940
You don't have to comfort me.

10:52.500 --> 10:53.130
I know

10:54.380 --> 10:56.640
he just doesn't want to come to see me off.

10:58.860 --> 10:59.790
That's not true.

11:00.890 --> 11:01.900
It's almost the auspicious time.

11:01.900 --> 11:06.450
♫The begonia is red, but every promise makes it more withered♫

11:02.060 --> 11:03.300
Look, you go ahead.

11:03.340 --> 11:05.200
I'll go check out on your brother.

11:07.180 --> 11:08.300
Liu Shao, go now.

11:08.300 --> 11:09.300
Let's not miss the auspicious time.

11:08.560 --> 11:13.300
♫It blooms alone, but the wind and rain are more violent♫

11:13.820 --> 11:19.880
♫Plants are not human beings, and ruthless fruits are planted♫

11:18.700 --> 11:19.460
Let's go.

11:20.870 --> 11:26.860
♫How can you forget the innocence and ignorance when we first met?♫

11:27.060 --> 11:30.100
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

11:30.270 --> 11:33.050
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

11:33.650 --> 11:36.190
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

11:36.190 --> 11:40.030
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

11:40.670 --> 11:43.760
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

11:43.970 --> 11:47.140
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

11:47.170 --> 11:53.310
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

12:00.900 --> 12:01.760
What do you mean

12:02.060 --> 12:02.980
by that?

12:03.940 --> 12:04.740
Your brother

12:04.860 --> 12:07.260
is planning to marry the one you love.

12:08.340 --> 12:09.540
I have a treasure

12:10.060 --> 12:12.060
that can unlock your brother's seal

12:12.420 --> 12:14.880
so that you can regain your spiritual power.

12:17.660 --> 12:19.900
Here is 30% of my power.

12:20.380 --> 12:21.660
It's enough for him to get rid of

12:21.660 --> 12:23.460
the Demon King in White's seal.

12:23.690 --> 12:25.100
But he has to swear

12:25.660 --> 12:26.620
to serve me as his master

12:26.620 --> 12:27.980
and obey my orders

12:28.530 --> 12:29.660
from now on.

12:31.100 --> 12:32.560
Cooperation is possible.

12:32.780 --> 12:33.660
Obey his orders

12:33.980 --> 12:35.380
and take him as my master?

12:35.700 --> 12:38.630
Even my brother wouldn't dare to talk to me like that.

12:39.420 --> 12:40.930
If this is true,

12:41.420 --> 12:43.300
it's between me and He Na.

12:43.700 --> 12:45.430
As for him trying to control me,

12:45.770 --> 12:46.500
no way!

12:52.220 --> 12:53.500
General Fu, you...

12:55.010 --> 12:55.700
Mr. Tai.

12:56.690 --> 12:58.300
Think about it.

12:59.020 --> 13:00.700
Is there something you

13:02.420 --> 13:03.580
you didn't tell me?

13:03.980 --> 13:04.780
General Fu,

13:05.300 --> 13:06.100
the marriage

13:06.100 --> 13:07.540
is not what you think.

13:08.620 --> 13:09.660
It's true.

13:11.340 --> 13:12.540
It's not what I think?

13:14.660 --> 13:16.380
So He Na and Luo Ning worked together

13:16.380 --> 13:17.780
to imprison me here

13:18.300 --> 13:19.100
just to make me watch them

13:19.100 --> 13:20.860
get married.

13:21.260 --> 13:22.180
General Fu.

13:22.900 --> 13:25.220
Don't fall for other people's provocations.

13:25.220 --> 13:27.100
How could His Majesty steal your beloved?

13:27.100 --> 13:28.100
Don't lie to me.

13:32.140 --> 13:32.980
So Mr. Tai,

13:33.940 --> 13:35.060
please tell me

13:36.780 --> 13:39.180
who He Na is going to marry now.

14:55.620 --> 14:56.890
If you don't go,

14:57.090 --> 14:58.740
Luo Ning will be crying.

15:04.420 --> 15:05.220
This is?

15:06.130 --> 15:07.500
This is a Ruyi pearl.

15:08.650 --> 15:10.860
The scriptures Luo Ning has been copying

15:10.860 --> 15:12.700
bear merit and virtue inside.

15:13.420 --> 15:15.820
With the protection of my spiritual power,

15:16.210 --> 15:17.690
it can ward off demons, calm the mind,

15:17.690 --> 15:20.350
and protect her from disasters with blessings.

15:20.460 --> 15:21.980
Please give it to Luo Ning for me.

15:21.980 --> 15:23.240
Tell her it's from you.

15:23.900 --> 15:25.340
Since you're so worried about her,

15:25.340 --> 15:26.870
why don't you go see her off?

15:28.340 --> 15:30.140
The closer she gets to getting married,

15:30.140 --> 15:31.400
the more uneasy I feel.

15:32.460 --> 15:35.120
I always feel like something is going to happen.

15:35.740 --> 15:36.380
Liu Shao.

15:38.260 --> 15:39.990
I don't want her to get married.

15:43.980 --> 15:46.460
Now she has to get married even if you don't want to.

15:46.460 --> 15:47.660
You don't want her to leave

15:47.660 --> 15:49.920
without even seeing her brother, do you?

15:58.100 --> 15:59.960
Looks like Luo Ge won't be coming.

16:11.740 --> 16:12.380
Let's go.

16:18.900 --> 16:19.450
Luo Ning.

16:25.460 --> 16:26.180
Brother.

16:31.740 --> 16:32.940
You're finally here.

16:33.500 --> 16:34.100
I'm sorry.

16:35.460 --> 16:36.380
I'm late.

16:40.860 --> 16:41.700
I thought

16:42.940 --> 16:44.620
you'd never talk to me again

16:45.620 --> 16:47.080
because of this marriage.

16:47.210 --> 16:47.860
Nonsense.

16:49.620 --> 16:50.500
Whenever it is,

16:51.540 --> 16:53.600
you will always be my closest sister.

16:54.330 --> 16:55.660
This will never change.

17:07.819 --> 17:10.420
This is the result of the countless scriptures you've copied.

17:10.420 --> 17:11.700
It contains the power of goodness you've accumulated

17:11.700 --> 17:13.020
since you were born.

17:13.980 --> 17:15.500
It can be used to guide others and yourself

17:15.500 --> 17:16.700
and avoid disasters.

17:17.780 --> 17:18.260
Here.

17:28.610 --> 17:29.900
So you're late

17:31.700 --> 17:33.900
because you were preparing this for me?

17:34.660 --> 17:35.190
Luo Ning.

17:37.060 --> 17:39.060
When you've done what you want to do,

17:39.380 --> 17:40.300
you can go home.

17:41.300 --> 17:43.500
I won't make you copy the scriptures anymore.

17:43.500 --> 17:43.900
Okay?

17:44.740 --> 17:45.860
Deal.

17:46.820 --> 17:48.350
I'll definitely come back.

17:48.620 --> 17:49.740
It's my house.

17:50.500 --> 17:52.660
No one else should be allowed to live there.

17:52.660 --> 17:53.060
Okay.

17:54.140 --> 17:56.000
Even if you want Palace Chonghua,

17:56.020 --> 17:57.080
I'll give it to you.

17:58.420 --> 17:59.820
That's nonsense.

18:00.220 --> 18:01.860
If I live in Palace Chonghua,

18:02.340 --> 18:03.470
where will you live?

18:04.820 --> 18:06.410
To live with Liu Shao?

18:11.450 --> 18:12.420
It's feasible.

18:15.820 --> 18:16.820
The one who is late,

18:16.820 --> 18:17.570
are you done?

18:17.660 --> 18:19.860
The auspicious time has almost passed.

18:28.180 --> 18:28.780
He Na.

18:29.140 --> 18:31.070
I'll leave my sister in your hands.

18:31.650 --> 18:33.710
I hope you won't forget your promise.

18:33.820 --> 18:35.220
I will do everything I can

18:35.850 --> 18:37.140
to make her as comfortable as she is

18:37.140 --> 18:38.340
in the Immortal Palace.

18:38.340 --> 18:40.070
And keep your brother in check,

18:40.940 --> 18:43.200
in case he badgers my sister like a viper.

18:44.300 --> 18:44.830
Brother.

18:45.220 --> 18:46.580
He has been sealed by me

18:46.940 --> 18:48.470
and is confined to his room.

18:48.740 --> 18:50.540
He will never see Luo Ning again.

18:51.740 --> 18:52.940
It's better this way.

20:04.340 --> 20:05.060
Luo Ge.

20:05.570 --> 20:07.370
You don't have to worry too much.

20:08.220 --> 20:09.570
If you're worried,

20:09.900 --> 20:11.300
when the curse is lifted,

20:11.500 --> 20:12.740
we can bring her back.

20:13.380 --> 20:14.710
Let her do as she wishes.

20:17.300 --> 20:19.100
It's not necessarily a bad thing

20:20.140 --> 20:21.940
to let her do what she wants to do.

20:34.500 --> 20:35.140
Fu.

20:35.940 --> 20:36.540
Are you going to

20:36.540 --> 20:38.870
stop them from getting married like this?

20:39.180 --> 20:40.780
Even if you're my savior

20:41.220 --> 20:43.100
and I'd be willing to do your bidding,

20:43.100 --> 20:43.810
I've managed to gather

20:43.810 --> 20:45.260
the men,

20:45.660 --> 20:47.660
are they going to get killed for you?

20:48.940 --> 20:50.740
I've done a lot for

20:51.620 --> 20:53.080
the men you collected too.

20:53.300 --> 20:54.060
Don't worry.

20:55.380 --> 20:56.980
I won't let them die in vain.

20:57.500 --> 20:59.260
No matter what the future holds,

20:59.260 --> 21:01.520
the top priority is to regain your power.

21:05.580 --> 21:06.180
I said

21:06.460 --> 21:07.790
no one could control me.

21:07.860 --> 21:09.390
As for recovering my power,

21:10.220 --> 21:11.350
it's not difficult.

21:22.740 --> 21:25.300
He Na once swallowed the Pearl of Fire for me

21:26.180 --> 21:28.310
and has endured the pain for ten years.

21:28.500 --> 21:30.980
And I have been grateful to him for 900 years.

21:32.020 --> 21:33.280
Since the brotherhood

21:33.940 --> 21:36.140
can begin with the Pearl of Fire,

21:39.930 --> 21:41.460
it can also end with it.

21:42.450 --> 21:43.580
Do you want to break the Demon King's seal

21:43.580 --> 21:44.900
with the Pearl of Fire?

21:45.170 --> 21:45.980
You're crazy.

21:46.300 --> 21:47.540
Water and fire are mutually exclusive.

21:47.540 --> 21:50.340
That's what you Aquatic Demons are most afraid of.

21:58.060 --> 21:58.620
Fu.

22:01.060 --> 22:01.660
Fu.

22:06.140 --> 22:07.340
Luo Ning is mine.

22:09.580 --> 22:11.620
Her groom can only be me.

22:13.130 --> 22:15.530
Why don't you do what I've arranged before?

22:15.650 --> 22:16.510
Get out of here!

23:01.860 --> 23:02.540
He Na.

23:04.300 --> 23:05.660
The wedding

23:07.100 --> 23:08.630
doesn't have to be so grand.

23:08.780 --> 23:09.310
Luo Ning.

23:10.050 --> 23:11.740
You are the benefactor of my people.

23:11.740 --> 23:12.600
It's only right

23:13.380 --> 23:15.040
to pay you with high courtesy.

23:17.410 --> 23:19.780
The auspicious time has come.

23:32.860 --> 23:33.540
Luo Ning.

23:48.900 --> 23:52.580
Greetings to the Demon King and the Demon Queen.

23:53.140 --> 23:57.420
Greetings to the Demon King and Demon Queen.

23:58.540 --> 24:01.020
I won't accept your betrayal!

24:08.420 --> 24:09.940
According to the rules of the demon realm,

24:09.940 --> 24:11.200
drink this cup of wine,

24:11.500 --> 24:13.820
then you will be recognized by heaven and earth

24:13.820 --> 24:15.410
and truly become the Demon Queen.

24:15.410 --> 24:16.420
Then from now on,

24:17.900 --> 24:20.760
I will be able to use the Bone-corroding Harp freely

24:25.700 --> 24:28.700
with the power of all the creatures in the demon realm.

24:29.180 --> 24:30.300
Does that mean

24:31.260 --> 24:33.390
I can also lift the 10,000-year curse?

24:34.220 --> 24:37.340
Witnessed by the demon kings and queens of all generations,

24:37.340 --> 24:39.660
by the Mother of Brahma Tree,

24:40.010 --> 24:43.140
by all the people of the Aquatic Demons,

24:45.860 --> 24:47.460
My Lord He Na

24:47.460 --> 24:50.900
is marrying the fairy Luo Ning today.

24:51.420 --> 24:54.540
Demon King and Demon Queen, please drink this together

24:54.540 --> 24:56.700
to complete the wedding.

25:30.180 --> 25:30.980
Your Majesty.

25:31.690 --> 25:32.490
Your Majesty.

25:33.660 --> 25:34.700
Something's happened in the demon realm.

25:34.700 --> 25:36.360
Mr. Tai has been attacked too.

25:37.260 --> 25:37.790
Luo Ning.

25:38.100 --> 25:39.220
I have to leave for a while.

25:39.220 --> 25:40.550
Wait for me for a moment.

25:46.700 --> 25:48.340
What's happened to the demon realm?

25:48.340 --> 25:49.300
Demon Queen, please follow me

25:49.300 --> 25:50.700
and have a moment of rest.

25:54.660 --> 25:56.060
We don't know who attacked Mr. Tai.

25:56.060 --> 25:57.500
We only saw him lie on the ground with injuries.

25:57.500 --> 25:59.500
The attacker is nowhere to be found.

26:14.380 --> 26:14.840
Mr. Tai.

26:17.780 --> 26:18.240
Come on.

26:19.060 --> 26:19.860
Your Majesty.

26:22.130 --> 26:23.060
What is going on?

26:23.220 --> 26:23.900
Bai Feng…

26:24.660 --> 26:26.590
Bai Feng has taken General Fu away.

26:26.660 --> 26:28.540
He knows about your marriage.

26:29.340 --> 26:30.460
General fu.

26:30.460 --> 26:32.580
Please trust me.

26:32.580 --> 26:34.020
And you must trust His Majesty.

26:34.020 --> 26:35.700
He is your brother.

26:35.700 --> 26:37.830
Do you think I'll ever trust him again?

26:40.900 --> 26:41.940
Fu escaped.

26:42.380 --> 26:43.580
What bothers him most

26:43.620 --> 26:45.480
should be my marriage to Luo Ning.

26:46.090 --> 26:46.460
No.

26:46.620 --> 26:47.220
Luo Ning.

26:52.940 --> 26:53.650
Fu?

26:54.380 --> 26:54.860
You…

26:55.060 --> 26:55.660
Luo Ning.

26:57.900 --> 26:58.300
No.

26:59.420 --> 27:01.300
Now should I call you

27:02.900 --> 27:03.630
Demon Queen?

27:03.860 --> 27:04.260
You…

27:18.660 --> 27:19.660
Where is Luo Ning?

27:43.220 --> 27:44.460
Why am I back?

27:45.060 --> 27:46.300
Shouldn't I be…

27:48.340 --> 27:49.100
Fu?

27:55.980 --> 27:57.100
You should be

27:57.700 --> 27:58.830
at the Demon Palace,

27:59.940 --> 28:00.940
married to He Na

28:01.620 --> 28:03.380
as the new demon queen, right?

28:06.140 --> 28:06.740
This is...

28:13.340 --> 28:15.140
This is not the Immortal Palace.

28:15.980 --> 28:18.500
It's not the Waterside Pavilion for Reflections.

28:18.500 --> 28:19.300
That's right.

28:19.700 --> 28:22.300
It's not Waterside Pavilion for Reflections.

28:24.210 --> 28:25.620
I had a crush on a girl.

28:26.700 --> 28:28.100
She's arrogant and wild.

28:29.220 --> 28:30.880
I wanted to marry her so badly.

28:32.820 --> 28:34.550
I was afraid she'll be wronged.

28:35.180 --> 28:37.110
I was afraid that she'll get upset.

28:37.660 --> 28:38.620
I prepared

28:38.860 --> 28:40.580
a room exactly like her home.

28:41.420 --> 28:43.750
I thought she should get used to it sooner.

28:44.380 --> 28:45.140
So

28:45.820 --> 28:46.980
this place was born.

28:54.220 --> 28:54.620
You...

28:58.020 --> 28:59.620
I thought you were locked up.

29:00.260 --> 29:01.340
How did you get out?

29:03.060 --> 29:04.390
And how did you get hurt?

29:05.540 --> 29:06.620
I have to pay a price

29:07.500 --> 29:08.660
for escaping

29:09.460 --> 29:11.260
and regaining power.

29:17.140 --> 29:18.270
It's ugly, isn't it?

29:19.540 --> 29:21.380
Fairy Luo Ning must not like it.

29:22.700 --> 29:23.740
But I like it.

29:24.860 --> 29:25.820
Do you know why?

29:29.300 --> 29:30.340
Because it hurts.

29:32.260 --> 29:34.120
It can make me hurt for a long time.

29:35.420 --> 29:36.930
It hurts so much that I remember

29:36.930 --> 29:38.660
what it's like

29:39.300 --> 29:41.700
to be betrayed by the two people I love most.

29:44.980 --> 29:46.140
No one betrayed you.

29:47.420 --> 29:48.780
You did the wrong thing.

29:49.140 --> 29:50.140
You deserve to be imprisoned.

29:50.140 --> 29:51.400
You shouldn't escape.

29:52.460 --> 29:54.520
It's wrong just because you say it is?

29:54.540 --> 29:56.400
If I didn't try, if I didn't fight,

29:56.450 --> 29:58.310
my people would have been doomed.

29:58.740 --> 30:00.220
Does that give you the reason

30:00.220 --> 30:01.620
to hurt innocent people

30:01.620 --> 30:03.060
and my friends and loved ones?

30:03.060 --> 30:04.920
I didn't want to hurt them either.

30:05.930 --> 30:06.900
If I could,

30:07.460 --> 30:09.180
I would like to be closer to your brother,

30:09.180 --> 30:11.310
so that he would agree to our marriage.

30:12.020 --> 30:14.020
But between your family and my clan,

30:14.020 --> 30:15.260
I had no other choice.

30:16.500 --> 30:17.690
Year after year,

30:17.690 --> 30:19.420
I've seen too many of our people

30:19.660 --> 30:20.780
living in torment

30:21.140 --> 30:22.470
and dying unwillingly.

30:22.700 --> 30:24.260
I couldn't just stand by and watch.

30:24.260 --> 30:25.700
I know how you feel.

30:27.180 --> 30:28.040
For a long time,

30:28.460 --> 30:30.120
I've been willing to help you.

30:30.420 --> 30:31.770
But what have you done?

30:33.100 --> 30:34.780
Look at what you've become now.

30:34.780 --> 30:36.810
You have become an unscrupulous madman.

30:36.810 --> 30:37.940
Do you know it?

30:39.300 --> 30:40.100
You're right.

30:41.260 --> 30:42.060
It's my fault.

30:42.660 --> 30:45.060
I hurt your family for the sake of my people.

30:45.740 --> 30:46.780
I also hurt you.

30:47.090 --> 30:48.150
I broke your heart.

30:48.500 --> 30:50.180
But you can hit me, scold me

30:50.180 --> 30:51.840
and stab me. I'll let you do it.

30:52.180 --> 30:53.820
How did you get to my brother's side

30:53.820 --> 30:55.750
and team up with him to imprison me?

31:00.330 --> 31:01.940
Did you think about how I'd feel

31:01.940 --> 31:03.620
in this wedding dress?

31:04.540 --> 31:05.870
What does it matter to me

31:06.500 --> 31:07.820
how you feel?

31:08.700 --> 31:11.180
Is that how you're trampling on my genuine feelings?

31:11.180 --> 31:12.840
Is that how you trampled on it?

31:12.980 --> 31:14.140
Keep your heart.

31:15.100 --> 31:15.960
I don't need it.

31:16.580 --> 31:17.540
From now on,

31:18.500 --> 31:20.860
I will only be your brother He Na's wife,

31:21.860 --> 31:23.790
the Demon Queen of Aquatic Demons.

31:26.220 --> 31:27.340
He Na's wife.

31:28.980 --> 31:30.710
Demon Queen of Aquatic Demons.

31:32.620 --> 31:33.150
Luo Ning.

31:34.220 --> 31:35.940
Where do you put me?

31:36.380 --> 31:37.700
Even if I'm wrong,

31:37.700 --> 31:38.940
are what we've experienced

31:38.940 --> 31:39.820
all fake?

31:40.380 --> 31:41.420
What made you

31:41.460 --> 31:43.520
fall into the arms of He Na so quickly?

31:46.020 --> 31:47.660
Why can't I choose He Na?

31:48.140 --> 31:50.060
Your brother is sophisticated and kind.

31:50.060 --> 31:50.980
He's a hundred times better,

31:50.980 --> 31:52.840
a thousand times better than you.

31:53.140 --> 31:54.900
One is violent and hurts me.

31:55.580 --> 31:57.910
The other is noble and kind and rescues me.

31:58.980 --> 31:59.840
Who do you think

32:01.620 --> 32:02.970
I should choose?

32:04.340 --> 32:04.940
So

32:08.620 --> 32:10.550
you've changed your mind long ago.

32:11.700 --> 32:14.300
You've liked He Na for a long time, haven't you?

32:14.900 --> 32:16.180
No matter who I like,

32:17.500 --> 32:19.020
I won't like you anymore.

32:20.620 --> 32:21.480
I'm going back.

32:22.420 --> 32:23.680
Take care of yourself.

32:24.260 --> 32:24.780
And

32:25.700 --> 32:26.660
from now on,

32:27.500 --> 32:29.780
don't think you can do anything to me again.

32:29.780 --> 32:30.620
Or else

32:31.660 --> 32:32.460
your brother

32:33.300 --> 32:34.100
and my brother

32:35.780 --> 32:36.820
won't let you off.

32:37.820 --> 32:38.980
Fairy Luo Ning.

32:39.460 --> 32:40.420
What are you doing?

32:40.420 --> 32:40.780
Let go of me.

32:40.780 --> 32:42.140
Don't forget.

32:43.140 --> 32:44.370
I am not He Na.

32:44.900 --> 32:45.900
I don't back down.

32:45.980 --> 32:46.980
I don't hold back.

32:47.380 --> 32:48.340
What I want to do,

32:48.340 --> 32:49.700
I will do it even at the cost of my life.

32:49.700 --> 32:50.980
And what I want to grasp,

32:50.980 --> 32:52.940
I'd rather die than let it go.

32:53.100 --> 32:53.660
And you

32:53.780 --> 32:55.180
have always been mine.

32:56.770 --> 32:58.100
No one can take you away,

32:59.100 --> 33:00.100
not He Na,

33:01.260 --> 33:02.580
not even your brother.

33:12.780 --> 33:13.370
He Na.

33:14.460 --> 33:16.380
Is this what you meant when you told me

33:16.380 --> 33:17.710
that you'd try your best

33:18.260 --> 33:20.700
to keep my sister safe for the rest of her life?

33:20.700 --> 33:21.500
Is this what you meant when you said

33:21.500 --> 33:23.360
that you'd imprison your brother

33:23.500 --> 33:24.860
for a hundred years?

33:30.980 --> 33:31.840
I never thought

33:32.540 --> 33:34.570
someone could break through my boundary.

33:34.570 --> 33:35.780
Within the Three Realms,

33:35.780 --> 33:37.180
few people can do that.

33:37.380 --> 33:39.440
Now is not the time to talk about this.

33:39.460 --> 33:40.700
The most important thing right now

33:40.700 --> 33:42.430
is to find out where Luo Ning is.

33:42.820 --> 33:44.050
What did Fu want

33:44.340 --> 33:45.540
to take Luo Ning away?

33:49.180 --> 33:50.440
He won't hurt Luo Ning.

33:50.620 --> 33:51.950
I'm afraid he has no idea

33:52.140 --> 33:53.600
how much he likes Luo Ning.

33:53.860 --> 33:55.620
But Luo Ning is going to marry you,

33:55.620 --> 33:57.820
his most respected brother and ruler.

33:57.900 --> 33:59.360
The more he likes Luo Ning,

33:59.700 --> 34:00.300
the worse

34:00.700 --> 34:01.690
this is.

34:02.100 --> 34:03.500
If Luo Ning can explain

34:04.210 --> 34:06.410
it's just a nominal marriage contract,

34:06.700 --> 34:07.900
Fu won't hurt her.

34:08.300 --> 34:10.100
But you know Luo Ning's character.

34:10.100 --> 34:11.460
She doesn't respond well to forcefulness.

34:11.460 --> 34:12.989
If Fu persuades her nicely,

34:13.179 --> 34:14.730
Luo Ning may explain.

34:15.780 --> 34:16.610
But if

34:17.060 --> 34:18.139
Fu has identified

34:19.060 --> 34:20.320
she's changed her mind

34:20.500 --> 34:21.900
and gets tough,

34:22.260 --> 34:23.860
Luo Ning won't explain a word

34:24.020 --> 34:25.210
even if she dies.

34:27.460 --> 34:28.900
I'll go and bring them back.

34:28.900 --> 34:30.460
Let's split up and look for them.

34:30.460 --> 34:30.820
He Na.

34:31.460 --> 34:33.389
You should know your brother best.

34:33.460 --> 34:35.120
Shouldn't you try to remember

34:35.620 --> 34:37.219
where he'd most likely went?

34:38.620 --> 34:40.820
I'll check the places he frequents now.

34:40.940 --> 34:42.380
If there is any information,

34:42.380 --> 34:43.980
I'll let you know right away.

34:45.170 --> 34:46.570
I'll do whatever it takes

34:47.300 --> 34:49.630
to keep him from making any more mistakes.

34:51.260 --> 34:51.820
He Na.

34:53.060 --> 34:53.860
This time,

34:55.139 --> 34:57.200
I advise you not to protect him again.

35:01.220 --> 35:03.220
Don't think of marrying He Na again.

35:03.620 --> 35:04.750
From today onwards,

35:07.380 --> 35:08.910
we will be a married couple.

35:14.610 --> 35:16.270
The son of the Melody race, Fu,

35:16.740 --> 35:17.470
is married to

35:18.140 --> 35:20.140
the fairy Luo Ning today.

35:20.780 --> 35:22.020
Witnessed by

35:22.580 --> 35:24.060
the Heaven and Earth,

35:24.380 --> 35:26.340
demon kings and queens of all generations,

35:26.340 --> 35:27.000
from now on,

35:28.060 --> 35:29.860
we will follow each other in life

35:30.100 --> 35:31.300
and in death.

35:32.220 --> 35:34.140
We will share the pain and suffering,

35:34.140 --> 35:35.400
never to be separated.

35:37.100 --> 35:43.820
♫In the sea of clouds, I looked at the reflection of the moon in the water♫

35:37.420 --> 35:39.060
If I, Fu, break this vow

35:40.100 --> 35:41.140
and fail Luo Ning,

35:41.700 --> 35:43.500
heaven and earth won't allow it.

35:43.860 --> 35:45.720
The gods and ghosts shall kill me,

35:45.780 --> 35:46.970
leaving me lonely

35:45.840 --> 35:50.000
♫I kept waiting and arched my palms into a circle♫

35:48.100 --> 35:49.260
forever and ever.

35:51.590 --> 35:57.810
♫The reflection gradually reminded me of our first meeting♫

35:55.020 --> 35:55.500
Kowtow.

35:58.520 --> 36:03.690
♫I can no longer tell the difference between wind and rain♫

36:04.910 --> 36:08.560
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

36:09.070 --> 36:12.590
♫I can't forget you♫

36:12.590 --> 36:16.160
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

36:16.420 --> 36:19.020
♫I have no other choice♫

36:19.020 --> 36:22.760
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

36:22.760 --> 36:25.570
♫For billions of years♫

36:25.900 --> 36:26.780
From now on,

36:25.970 --> 36:29.810
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

36:28.220 --> 36:29.680
we'll be husband and wife.

36:29.810 --> 36:32.710
♫A few hasty nights♫

36:31.540 --> 36:33.580
Even if you get married to someone else later,

36:33.010 --> 36:36.910
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

36:36.570 --> 36:37.500
it won't count.

36:36.910 --> 36:40.310
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

36:40.310 --> 36:46.850
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch♫

36:57.260 --> 36:58.060
Your Majesty.

36:58.180 --> 36:58.980
We've identified

36:58.980 --> 37:01.570
his hiding place

37:01.900 --> 37:02.780
through

37:03.020 --> 37:05.480
the moss marks left on General Fu's clothes.

37:06.420 --> 37:08.150
He went to the Great Wilderness

37:08.340 --> 37:10.170
and never left.

37:10.300 --> 37:10.780
Okay.

37:11.380 --> 37:13.020
Give me the exact location of the mark.

37:13.020 --> 37:14.300
I'll go there now.

37:27.540 --> 37:28.340
Your Majesty.

37:29.060 --> 37:29.930
General Fu

37:29.930 --> 37:31.300
misunderstood you.

37:31.700 --> 37:32.820
He always thought

37:32.820 --> 37:35.300
Fairy Luo Ning married you and became the demon queen

37:35.300 --> 37:37.340
because she fell in love with you.

37:39.660 --> 37:41.460
Since it's a misunderstanding,

37:42.130 --> 37:43.460
it can always be solved.

37:48.500 --> 37:49.830
Shang Yurong, how is it?

37:51.260 --> 37:52.520
What's the situation?

37:53.220 --> 37:54.530
Has He Na come out yet?

38:06.380 --> 38:07.540
There's no news yet.

38:08.100 --> 38:09.020
But don't worry.

38:09.020 --> 38:10.280
I'll keep a close eye on

38:10.540 --> 38:12.020
the Moon Washing Pond.

38:13.180 --> 38:13.850
Good.

38:13.850 --> 38:14.780
Keep an eye on it.

38:14.890 --> 38:16.820
Call me as soon as there is any news.

38:18.860 --> 38:19.460
He Na.

38:20.580 --> 38:22.420
I know what you're thinking.

38:23.900 --> 38:25.940
I will never let Fu go.

38:38.940 --> 38:40.220
Luo Ge.

38:40.700 --> 38:42.100
You were right!

38:42.260 --> 38:43.460
What did I say?

38:44.100 --> 38:45.420
Demons can't be trusted,

38:45.420 --> 38:47.380
not to mention building a marriage with them.

38:47.380 --> 38:48.780
But you didn't listen to me.

38:48.780 --> 38:50.780
You had to make Luo Ning suffer.

38:51.140 --> 38:52.140
Immortal Master.

38:52.420 --> 38:54.150
It's Fu who's causing trouble.

38:54.500 --> 38:55.500
We can still trust

38:55.740 --> 38:57.020
He Na.

38:59.580 --> 39:01.380
There is news from Shang Yurong.

39:01.460 --> 39:03.140
He Na has gone to the Great Wilderness.

39:03.140 --> 39:04.900
He must have gotten a clue about Fu.

39:04.900 --> 39:06.700
I'm going to bring Luo Ning back.

39:07.260 --> 39:07.700
Ge.

39:09.900 --> 39:10.900
I'll go with you.

39:11.210 --> 39:12.180
How can I feel at ease

39:12.180 --> 39:13.820
without seeing Luo Ning?

39:14.100 --> 39:14.500
Okay.

39:27.260 --> 39:29.260
After worshipping Heaven and Earth,

39:29.260 --> 39:31.660
here is the wedding wine I prepared for you.

39:32.100 --> 39:33.300
Our wedding ceremony

39:33.860 --> 39:34.820
will be complete

39:36.300 --> 39:37.220
with this.

39:39.940 --> 39:40.780
Wedding?

39:42.180 --> 39:43.020
I think

39:43.820 --> 39:45.060
this is a farce.

39:46.060 --> 39:47.660
I don't care what you call it.

39:48.060 --> 39:48.860
In my opinion,

39:49.420 --> 39:51.100
we're already a couple.

39:51.940 --> 39:53.140
After this drink,

39:53.580 --> 39:56.380
even if you still want to go and get married to He Na,

39:56.460 --> 39:57.500
I won't stop you.

39:59.540 --> 40:00.170
Really?

40:01.260 --> 40:01.860
Of course.

40:04.020 --> 40:04.540
What?

40:05.740 --> 40:07.140
Are you afraid of poison?

40:10.380 --> 40:11.380
You won't kill me.

40:14.500 --> 40:15.560
You wouldn't dare.

40:49.780 --> 40:50.510
That's good.

40:51.970 --> 40:56.290
[Joy]

40:52.500 --> 40:54.900
Now that we've worshipped Heaven and Earth

40:55.260 --> 40:56.790
and drunk the wedding wine,

40:57.100 --> 40:57.820
now

40:58.540 --> 40:59.900
even Heaven and Earth

41:00.060 --> 41:01.790
have recognized us as a couple.

41:02.940 --> 41:05.540
Who would dare to disagree that we are a couple?

41:14.780 --> 41:17.240
Why did you summon the Bone-corroding Harp?

41:20.060 --> 41:21.320
Bone-corroding Harp?

41:23.340 --> 41:24.400
I didn't summon it.

41:27.700 --> 41:28.460
Does it

41:30.660 --> 41:31.460
think

41:32.740 --> 41:34.340
I'm already the Demon Queen?

41:37.540 --> 41:39.140
You won't be the Demon Queen.

41:39.900 --> 41:40.430
Luo Ning.

41:45.060 --> 41:47.060
The wedding wine you drank

41:47.300 --> 41:48.900
was made from Phoenix Tears.

41:49.650 --> 41:50.910
It will make you forget

41:51.420 --> 41:52.820
your beloved ones.
